NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008264 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008265 "=head2 Mailing List"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008266 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008267 "The I<dbi-users> mailing list is the primary means of communication among"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008268 "users of the DBI and its related modules. For details send email to:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008269 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008270 " L<dbi-users-help@perl.org>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008271 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008272 "There are typically between 700 and 900 messages per month.  You have"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008273 "to subscribe in order to be able to post. However you can opt for a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008274 "'post-only' subscription."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008275 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008276 "Mailing list archives (of variable quality) are held at:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008277 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008278 " http://groups.google.com/groups?group=perl.dbi.users"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008279 " http://www.xray.mpe.mpg.de/mailing-lists/dbi/"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00008280 " http://www.mail-archive.com/dbi-users%40perl.org/"
